      "Excluded (18 files, all of them): `next build` cannot even load these fixtures' `next.config.ts`",
      "without `--experimental-next-config-strip-types`, which is what sets",
      "`__NEXT_NODE_NATIVE_TS_LOADER_ENABLED` and makes Next.js `import()` the config through Node's",
      "native TypeScript loader. Without it Next.js falls back to transpiling the config with swc and",
